	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"“The Acknowledgement—an ancient tome, bound not by thread and leather, but by fate and legacy.”"
				""
				"“It is your guide through the Journey of Enigmatic Legacy, a beacon in the dark, whispering truths long buried.”"
				""
				"“Within its ever-turning pages lies every fragment of knowledge you uncover: the secrets of cursed artifacts, the origins of forgotten relics, and the stories etched into the bones of this world.”"
				""
				"“It does not teach—it remembers. And through it, you will remember too.”"
				""
				"“Carry it well, Adventurer. For in a world lost to time… knowledge is power.”"
				""
				"\"...\""
				""
				"\"Oh, and you want to cosplay John Wick? Then this is the Weapon for you.\""
			]
