		{
			dependencies: ["41715B42D35EDF22"]
			description: [
				"In the ever-twisting, cruel dance of fate, experience is often the first sacrifice upon death's embrace. But what if your precious knowledge could be preserved, untouched by the decay of time and mortality?"
				""
				"The Scroll of Ageless Wisdom acts as a timeless vessel, a sacred storage that absorbs and safeguards all your experience. Fear not the loss of hard-earned wisdom."
				""
				"When the moment comes, and you once again seek the power of the ages, the scroll shall return every fragment of your gathered knowledge."
				""
				"Your journey is long, but your wisdom shall never fade... "
			]
			id: "08637E44D20B542C"
