			}]
			x: -7.5d
			y: -9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["41715B42D35EDF22"]
			description: [
				"Even for a being touched by divinity like yourself, death remains a troublesome annoyance. Each fall strips you of your treasures, your hard-earned knowledge, and the countless relics you carried."
				""
				"But no longer."
				""
				"With the Scroll of Postmortal Recall, this cruel cycle is broken. Upon your demise, everything you bore—your weapons, your artifacts, even your memories—will be preserved, tethered to your soul. When you awaken, it will all still be with you, as if death itself had merely brushed against you, powerless."
				""
				"Yet... the Scroll itself will not follow you. It shall remain, solemnly standing where your body fell, a silent witness to your final battle. Waiting for your return... or to be lost to time forever."
				""
				"Will you risk it, Adventurer? Will you embrace its blessing—or leave a piece of your fate behind?"
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 Loot Bundle"
			]
			id: "6DE1630D1AA519E8"
			rewards: [{
				id: "76148C6EEF91E993"
