				"\"The &dEye of the Nebula&f, a Spellstone crystallized from the pure essence of the End itself.\""
				""
				"\"Discovered within the strange, warped lands at the edge of reality, it brims with raw enderic energy—an echo of the dimension’s very soul.\""
				""
				"\"Those who dare to attune with it may find themselves glimpsing through the veils of space, time, and fate.\""
