		{
			dependencies: ["41715B42D35EDF22"]
			description: [
				"This is no mere parchment. The Darkest Scroll is an artifact shrouded in ancient ink and even darker secrets. It is believed to have borne silent witness to every vile sin humanity has ever committed—every betrayal, every cruelty, every unspoken desire."
				""
				"Darkened not by time, but by the insatiable greed and corruption of man, this scroll has absorbed it all. Its script writhes with ink that moves on its own, whispering forgotten names and cursed intentions."
				""
				"Now, it rests deep within the treasure hoards of the Piglins, who guard it fiercely. They do not understand its true nature, only that it holds power—twisted, forbidden power."
				""
				"Some say reading from the scroll may grant forbidden knowledge… others say it will curse your very soul."
				""
				"Will you dare to unroll it, Adventurer? Or will you let it sleep among gold and ash, waiting for the next fool to seek its secrets?"
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 enchanted golden apple, x4 blaze powder, 1x Loot Bundle"
			]
