		{
			dependencies: ["41715B42D35EDF22"]
			description: [
				"Have you ever thought that the sky was the limit? That there was no further beyond? Then you have not yet touched the true blessing hidden among the clouds."
				""
				"The Gift of the Heaven is a sacred scroll, granting the bearer the ability to soar through the skies, like an angel whispered into existence. Though not entirely free — your wings beat strongest within the embrace of a beacon's range — it is still a flight few could ever dream of."
				""
				"With the power of Heaven woven into your soul, Adventurer, the sky is no longer your limit. It is your playground."
