		{
			description: [
				"\"There is something more to the End... something far beyond the End itself.\""
				""
				"\"Beneath the drifting islands and shimmering skies lies the &8Great Void&f — a place untouched by time, unshaped by gods, where even air dares not linger.\""
				""
				"\"Many who wandered too close to the edge have vanished, their souls swallowed by the silent abyss. For most, it is a realm of finality — a place of no return.\""
				""
				"\"And yet… it speaks.\""
				""
				"\"Deep within that formless dark, there exists the &5Pearl of the Void&f — a Spellstone not of flame, nor frost, nor storm, but of something... older.\""
				""
				"\"Its properties defy all known magic, whispering truths that unmake reality itself, as if the Void were not the absence of all elements — but an element on its own.\""
				""
				"\"None know how it surfaced. None know what it cost to bring it back. Only that it should not be here.\""
				""
				""
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 totem of void undying, x1 Loot Bundle"
