		{
			description: [
				"Once, in a time long past, there existed a legendary warrior who bore this emblem—a symbol of unmatched strength, a token of honor, and a pledge to protect the weak from the monstrous beasts that roamed the lands."
				""
				"But now? The emblem lies shattered, its power lost in the winds of history, its fragments scattered across the vast, forgotten corners of the world. It is said that the warrior, too, has fallen to darkness, leaving behind only the relic, awaiting the one who could once again forge it into its former glory."
				""
				"Could you be that one? The chosen one to awaken the slumbering might of the Emblem of Monster Slayer? Perhaps, within the ruins of ancient lands, you will find the lost pieces and restore it to its rightful form. Once awakened, this emblem will grant you the power to hunt and slay monsters, the strength to face even the most horrific beasts, and the courage to stand against the shadows."
				""
				"Will you take up the mantle and breathe life into this forgotten artifact?"
			]
