		{
			description: [
				"A mysterious and eerie artifact, The Extradimensional Eye possesses the power to capture the very essence of life itself. When activated, the eye opens a portal to another dimension, one that binds the soul of an animal, trapping it inside its lens. This bond is unbreakable, and once trapped, the animal’s soul is bound to the eye forever."
				""
				"However, such power comes at a great cost. The eye is a fragile creation, and once used, it will shatter and be lost to the void, its magic dissipating with its final use. The creature’s soul will be kept safe within its crystalline chamber, but its freedom is forever lost—until you decide to release it."
				""
				"The eye can be used to carry your faithful companion through dangerous lands, and into the farthest reaches of the unknown. But beware: the fate of the soul trapped within the eye is in your hands. Will you carry it with care, or will you disregard the consequences of such a twisted bond?"
				""
				"Use wisely, for you may never get the chance again."
			]
