		{
			dependencies: ["62859BB1F4E230CB"]
			description: [
				"Long ago, when the End was still untouched and brimming with arcane energies, it was blessed with a rare and radiant ore known as Etherium."
				""
				"Forged from the very essence of cosmic power, Etherium became the backbone of ancient civilizations, woven into their armor, their relics, and even their souls."
				""
				"But time, cruel and relentless, devoured it all."
