		{
			dependencies: ["3D95E76A73543BF4"]
			description: [
				"Bearer of the Curse… Have you ever wondered what a life untouched by shadows might be like?"
				""
				"What if the Ring of the Seven Curses never touched your hand? What if all this, the suffering and power, were but a fleeting nightmare?"
				""
				"The answer lies within the Unholy Stone—an ancient relic forged by the Elder Gods themselves to defy the curses of the Eldritch Beings."
				""
				"Hold this stone, and seek out the deepest Lava Pool in the Nether. Dive into its fiery depths, and death shall claim you. The Ring shall be destroyed."
				""
				"When you awaken, you will find yourself in the warmth of your bed, free from the Ring’s grasp. The curses, and the blessings… gone."
				""
				"Know this, Wanderer—this path is irreversible. Once you choose, there is no turning back."
				""
				"So, will you accept the Curses that have shaped you, or will you cast aside the blessings that have empowered you?"
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 Loot Bundle"
			]
