		{
			dependencies: ["3D95E76A73543BF4"]
			description: [
				"“So, you have slain the Wither and claimed the Nefarious Essence that lingers at its demise…”"
				""
				"“Now, it is time to strengthen your Acknowledgement.”"
				""
				"“The Acknowledgement—a powerful tome, both a weapon and a wellspring of knowledge—has served you well, but it is nothing compared to what awaits.”"
				""
				"“By combining the Nefarious Essence with the Acknowledgement, you shall create The Twist—a dark and twisted artifact that merges destruction with enlightenment.”"
