		{
			description: [
				"Are you an Animal Lover? Or perhaps... a kind-hearted soul, a Vegan who cherishes every life and seeks to protect all creatures? You don’t want to mistakenly harm these innocent beings, do you?"
				""
				"Then, The Guide to Animal Companionship is exactly what your gentle heart needs."
				""
				"With this book in your hands, your presence will no longer bring harm to any innocent creature. Even the fierce Hoglin, once naturally aggressive, will see you not as a threat, but as a playful companion, wagging its tail like a joyful puppy."
				""
				"Compassion blooms wherever you go. ⸜(｡˃ ᵕ ˂)⸝"
			]
