		}
		{
			description: [
				"Have you ever felt a chill run down your spine, fearing that your beloved pet may one day perish…? Be it at the cruel claws of a vile monster, or a tragic accident in a pool of scorching lava...?"
				""
				"Fear no more."
				""
				"With the Guide to Feral Hunt, the bond between you and your loyal companion grows unbreakable. Every harm that dares to befall your pet, every wound meant for them... will be redirected to you instead."
				""
				"They shall remain safe, shielded by your undying love... but you? You will carry their pain, their suffering, all in silence."
				""
				"It is the price of true protection... The mark of a guardian’s heart."
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 cat spawn egg"
