				"“How does the Elder Guardian command the endless tides of its kind?”"
				""
				"“The answer lies not in its size, nor in its strength… but in the ancient secret nestled within its chest—the Heart of the Guardian.”"
				""
				"“A relic of deep oceanic power, pulsing with ancient magic older than time itself. Through it, the Elder bends the will of the seas, summoning the unwavering loyalty of every Guardian it lays eyes upon.”"
				""
				"“And now… you wonder.”"
				""
				"“Can you claim that power?”"
				""
				"“Can a Cursed Wanderer, whose path reeks of corruption and ambition, steal the heart of the sea’s ancient sentinel?”"
				""
				"“Perhaps.”"
				""
				"“But beware—some hearts do not wish to be taken.”"
			]
