		{
			description: [
				"“There exists a tale, passed from tongue to tongue, from fire-lit night to moonlit silence — the tale of the First Ones, Adam and Eve, cast from the celestial garden over a single, fateful bite of a Fruit.”"
				""
				"“The Forbidden Fruit.”"
				""
				"“Long has it slumbered in silence, its power waned… Yet even now, after countless ages, something within it stirs.”"
				""
				"“It no longer grants divine knowledge. That gift is lost to time. But its Enigmatic Ability still lingers — a blessing… or perhaps, a curse.”"
				""
				"“For those who dare consume it shall never know hunger again… nor shall they ever eat again.”"
				""
				"“Eternally full. Forever hollow.”"
				""
				"“Is that the mercy of the Heavens… or the cruelty of the Divine?”"
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 Loot Bundle"
			]
