		{
			dependencies: ["19DF6D39AF363A9F"]
			description: [
				"“The Enigmatic Amulet once bore a sign—a faint Blessing from Above. But for you… that is no longer enough.”"
				""
				"“You have walked a path of shadows and storms, carved your name into forgotten ruins and cursed tomes.”"
				""
				"“You have endured. You have conquered. You have ascended.”"
				""
				"“Now, as recognition for all you have suffered, the heavens offer a final gift: the Amulet of Ascension.”"
				""
				"“A relic not merely of power, but of divine acknowledgment—for the Adventurer who wandered through the Unknown, for the Wanderer who conquered the Darkness.”"
				""
				"“This amulet… is you. A reflection of your legacy. A fragment of the light you thought you had lost.”"
