		{
			dependencies: ["3B8FA3A0F9118BCC"]
			description: [
				"“Even after you have corrupted the Acknowledgement with the Nefarious Essence… Even though the Twist now bends to your will…”"
				""
				"“It is not enough.”"
				""
				"“Your thirst for power is unquenchable. As a bearer of Curses, you crave not peace, nor salvation—only power. Endless, boundless power.”"
				""
				"“Now, with the Heart of the Abyss in your grasp, a new path unfolds before you… the path to The Infinitum.”"
				""
				"“By further corrupting the Twist, the Heart shall merge with it, and The Infinitum shall awaken—its Eye opening for the first time in eons.”"
				""
				"“It watches you, unblinking… not as an ally, nor as a servant. But as a judge.”"
				""
				"“It sees the depths of your greed, the hunger clawing at your soul… and it does not forget.”"
