		{
			description: [
				"\"Throughout the ages, countless seekers of power have dared to claim the six primordial Spellstones — each a fragment of creation’s raw essence. And yet, with ambition unbound, they dreamed of something more…\""
				""
				"\"A union. A convergence of forces so vast, so reality-defying, that none could fathom its outcome.\""
				""
				"\"Most perished in madness. Others vanished into the folds of twisted realms.\""
				""
				"\"But you, have succeeded.\""
				""
				"\"The &dHeart of the Cosmos&f, a celestial force beyond mortal comprehension, now pulses within your grasp. With it, you forge the &5Non-Euclidean Cube&f — a construct that defies logic, dimension, and fate itself.\""
				""
				"\"This artifact is not merely power... it is dominion. Over time. Over space. Over death.\""
				""
				"\"For as long as this cube endures, so too shall your will.\""
				""
				"\"And thus, in its presence... you are eternal.\""
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 Loot Bundle"
			]
			id: "04E302A59593F58C"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "385B25EE74CCB4B0"
				item: "lootbundles:loot_bundle"
