				item: "enigmaticlegacy:the_cube"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"“A divine fruit slumbers within the City at the End of the Journey.”"
				""
				"“Radiant and untouched, it pulses with forgotten power—awaiting a soul bound by fate, by burden, by Curses.”"
				""
				"“To consume it is to strengthen your soul, to widen the path carved by your suffering. With its blessing, you shall gain the strength to wear an additional Ring, and with it, wield more power.”"
				""
				"“But beware, Wanderer.”"
				""
				"“The fruit is not for the hesitant. It only reveals itself if your first treasure chest is opened while wearing the Ring of the Seven Curses.”"
				""
				"“If you fail this trial—if you come unmarked, unscarred—then the fruit shall vanish from this world, never to be found again.”"
				""
				"“Even if you wear the Ring later… it shall no longer see you as worthy.”"
			]
