		{
			dependencies: ["3B8FA3A0F9118BCC"]
			description: [
				"“The Amulet of Ascension is now yours… but why?”"
				""
				"“Why does your heart still feel empty?”"
				""
				"“You—the Cursed Adventurer, the Wanderer of Ruin—you are not content.”"
				""
				"“Your thirst knows no bounds. You crave more. More than power. More than divinity. You would curse the very heavens if it meant gaining an inch more strength.”"
				""
				"“And the Heart of the Abyss... it watches.”"
				""
				"“It judges. But you no longer care.”"
				""
				"“Instead, it offers. A pact. A perversion.”"
				""
				"“Corrupt the Amulet of Ascension, and let it grow twisted into the Testament of Contempt.”"
				""
				"“A wretched thing with a single, glaring eye—filled not with wonder or mercy… but with pure, unyielding judgment.”"
				""
				"“It stares into your soul.”"
				""
				"“And you stare back.”"
				""
				"“You do not care. For in the end… it is Power you seek. Endless. Absolute. Eternal.”"
				""
				"&7Rewards: x1 Loot Bundle"
			]
