		{
			dependencies: ["709F519678E10920"]
			description: [
				"For countless moons, the Cursed Adventurer — you — have borne the scorn of a world that never understood, never forgave. You who never struck first, yet always bled.\""
				""
				"\"But now... no more.\""
				""
				"\"The &dHeart of the Abyss&f, ancient and all-seeing, offers its dark mercy once more.\""
				""
				"\"And from that mercy, the &8Burden of Desolation&f is born.\""
				""
				"\"A silent decree written into the fabric of existence — any creature, mortal or not, who dares raise hostility against you...\""
				""
				"\"...shall be undone, erased from time’s weave within mere minutes.\""
				""
				"\"No blade will reach you. No claw shall pierce your skin.\""
				""
				"\"Only silence remains... and you, untouched.\""
				""
				"\"Safe. And utterly, irrevocably... alone.\""
