		{
			description: [
				"&e&l! &f&r“Upon using the Eye... you may hear a voice.”"
				""
				"“Faint, distant—like someone watching from beyond the veil of reality.”"
				""
				"…"
				""
				"“Alright, alright, let’s drop the whole ‘Enigma’ tone for a second.”"
				""
				"“I don’t know his real name—nobody does—but I’ve always called him John.”"
				""
